OL,3,GNEWSAReform UK's Council of Sanctuary
OL,4,Arethink bid fails
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn attempt to force a rethink on a
OL,7,Flocal authority's decision to seek
OL,8,FCouncil of Sanctuary status has failed.
OL,10,FHertfordshire County Council's scrutiny
OL,11,Fcommittee rejected a move by Reform UK
OL,12,Fcouncillors on Tuesday to have the
OL,13,Fdecision reconsidered.
OL,15,FReform politicians told the meeting the
OL,16,Fpublic had not been consulted and
OL,17,Fmisleading information had been given
OL,18,Fabout the cost of the status.
OL,20,FBut Liberal Democrat members argued
OL,21,Fthat the correct procedure had been
OL,22,Ffollowed and the cost would be minimal.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
